---

```=html
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;max-width:26rem">
  <p class="hint">choose how to sign in:</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/api/auth/kanidm" style="text-align:center;text-decoration:none">[ sign in with kanidm ]</a>
  <a class="btn" href="/api/auth/discord" style="text-align:center;text-decoration:none">[ sign in with discord ]</a>
  <p class="hint">signing in lets you upload without the cf captcha and with higher limits.</p>
  <p id="login-error" class="hint" style="display:none;color:var(--nord11)">login failed, try again</p>
</div>
<script>
  if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("error")) {
    document.getElementById("login-error").style.display = "";
  }
</script>
```
